Concept used:

A³ - B³ = (A - B) (A² + AB + B²)

A² - B² = (A + B) (A - B)

Middle Term Factor

Calculation:

frac{{( {{x³} - {y³}} )( {{x²} + 5x + 6} )( {{x⁴} - 16} )}}{{( {x - y} )( {x + 3} )( {x - 2} )( {{x²} + 4} )}}

⇒ {(x - y) (x² + y² + xy) (x + 2)(x + 3) (x² - 4) (x² + 4)} over {(x - y) (x + 3) (x - 2) (x² + 4)}

⇒ {(x - y) (x² + y² + xy) (x + 2)(x + 3) (x - 2) (x + 2) (x² + 4)} over {(x - y) (x + 3) (x - 2) (x² + 4)}

⇒ (x2 + y2 + xy) (x + 2)2

**∴ The required answer is (x2 + y2 + xy) (x + 2)2.**
